SCENE
ID=PRIORITY_TEST_001
NAME=Universal Priority Test
DESC=Universal turn priority runtime test
CATEGORY=NORMAL
CAPABILITIES=TURN_SIGNAL_COMPATIBLE
COLORS
amber=255,80,0
SCRIPT
MOVE BOTH POS 55 SPEED 90
WAIT TARGET
SET BOTH MAINLEDS COLOR amber
SET BOTH LENS COLOR amber
SHOW
wait 500ms
clear both MAINLEDS
CLEAR BOTH LENS
WAIT 500ms
END
